37"}, {"file_name": "CIRecon_SS_4 2560x1440.png", "id": "1443657016474755", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035416_1443657019808088_2486947651465581524_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YIjrQLFTXOgQ7kNvwESEbvD&_nc_oc=AdqMj_Hpk56Px0-uKFZxwjW1bevjWiRGFK8k99BR2YZAW1xtNmjTGfKJPZ_OsqI-umk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLRDK5zraKtXSlOHEnvdxx5RQx-_2s7BrABItrSjU6LAA&oe=6AB67783"}, {"file_name": "CIRecon_SS_3 2560x1440.png", "id": "610435117841403", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035361_610435121174736_7614005424375505611_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SytzsZGdczgQ7kNvwGH7xdN&_nc_oc=Adp7Zw84hPNKrApyhsmN6EPJm_lvJbat4zSYuDpZTCQTQtduQ5LGkrdgk7G15SOh6N4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ43p7Yx7vWWx8qbXaSvrbD6_5u3ZUhFocNqHuNXYZuSQ&oe=6AB6748F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CIRecon_SS_5 2560x1440.png", "id": "120405504445546", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_120405507778879_6926521371564161931_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CSxYP6XemeoQ7kNvwFoUuF0&_nc_oc=AdpeKR013LEmrgtWJnNtTBpNmNp3Bp3nHbfyciEh7XHQ2MTW_F_S3BUCdV8P6BpFokw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKWCcE49_FazMKew7UC1hkimwrA5VEVcDzPBwgwJJzMxg&oe=6AB68CC7"}, "display_name": "Containment Initiative: Recon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Containment Initiative: Recon is a singleplayer version of Containment Initiative designed for standalone headsets.\n\nRealistic Reloading:\nEach weapon handles and reloads just like it's real world counterpart. Mastering reloading is essential to surviving the horde!\n\nProgression:\nRobust progression system which includes: Unlockable guns, attachments, player upgrades, and more.\n\nMission Types:\nCollect supply crates, defend objectives, or just try to survive the horde.\n\nLoot:\nFind random drops 